    "2. **SH-07.2 - Sequencing and bindings:** Lower `if`, `do` and `let` with\n   L2 truthiness, exactly one selected branch, sequential initializer scope\n   and left-to-right evaluation. Include empty/terminal bodies where legal,\n   shadowing and nested control. Reject malformed arity/bindings and lost or\n   reordered evaluated source occurrences."}}
  {:id "SH-07.3",
   :milestone "SH-07",
   :source
   {:path "docs/self-hosting-milestone-completion-plan.md",
    :start-byte 22708,
    :end-byte 23112,
    :start-line 371,
    :end-line 376,
    :sha256
    "020ac64009cf96bd6c1e4ad8da2167c56b823e25c8b6b51304a2389f31b49555",
    :raw
    "3. **SH-07.3 - Functions and recursion:** Lower `fn`, calls, `loop` and\n   `recur`, including compiler-required closures, function values and\n   recursive call shapes. Preserve operator/argument evaluation, target,\n   tail position and arity. Reject invalid call/Core shapes, absent or\n   incompatible recur targets and incorrect recur arity. Type compatibility\n   is checked by SH-08, not guessed by C6."}}
  {:id "SH-07.4",
   :milestone "SH-07",
   :source
   {:path "docs/self-hosting-milestone-completion-plan.md",
    :start-byte 23113,
    :end-byte 23553,
