    :sha256
    "13ead4e463cd4eadf7b0ba0cab5c9450f59d6631cf832c6c835206d344979336",
    :raw
    "4. **SH-07.4 - Mutation and errors:** Lower `set!`, `try` and `throw` with\n   explicit location/RHS order, handler scope/order and normal/error exits;\n   preserve required cleanup semantics. Reject invalid mutable-location\n   shapes, malformed handlers and illegal control placement. Carry type,\n   mutation/error effect, capability and profile obligations to their owners;\n   lowering success does not grant runtime mutation or exceptions."}}
  {:id "SH-07.5",
   :milestone "SH-07",
   :source
   {:path "docs/self-hosting-milestone-completion-plan.md",
    :start-byte 23554,
    :end-byte 24218,
    :start-line 383,
    :end-line 391,
    :sha256
    "b864d1f654b23019e352283b3dd5955387be062ab95f8dcd77792cfc4d5415e4",
    :raw
    "5. **SH-07.5 - Match decision structure:** Lower all pattern variants required\n   by the compiler closure, including scalar/quoted-symbol literals,\n   wildcard/binding/default, recursive collection/record/union shapes and\n   guards when used. Preserve scrutinee-once, clause order, branch scope,\n   bindings and structural-failure/guard/body control. Reject duplicate\n   pattern bindings, malformed constructors/guards and unsupported patterns.\n   L7 requires normally returning guards to be Bool, evaluated once after\n   structural success; SH-08 owns that type check and narrowing/totality,\n   SH-09 guard effects, SH-10 moves/borrows, and SH-13 runtime control."}}
  {:id "SH-07.6",
   :milestone "SH-07",
   :source
   {:path "docs/self-hosting-milestone-completion-plan.md",
    :start-byte 24219,
